"Pressbooks无法在您的WordPress上安装。Pressbooks必须安装在一个专用的WordPress "
"MU上，且最低版本是 %s ，请升级您的WordPress以满足Pressbooks安装要求。"

msgid ""
"The Pressbooks plugin is inactive, but you have active plugins that require "
"Pressbooks. This is causing errors. Please go to the Plugins page, and "
"activate Pressbooks."
msgstr ""
"Pressbooks插件当前未启用，但确有依赖于它的其他插件是启用的，这会造成错误。请"
"打开插件页面，启用Pressbooks。"

