#, php-format
msgid ""
"The last PDF you exported has %s pages (you can edit this below if you like)."
msgstr "您导出的最后一个 PDF 有 %s 页（您可以在下面编辑）。"

msgid ""
"We can calculate the spine size based on CreateSpace and Ingram "
"specifications, or you can enter your own custom pages per inch (PPI) "
"defined by your printer."
msgstr ""
"我们可以根据 CreateSpace 和 Ingram 规格计算书脊尺寸，或者您可以输入您的打印机"
"定义的自定义每英寸页数 (PPI)。"

msgid "Custom&hellip;"
msgstr "自定义&hellip;"

msgid "Choose text color and background colors below."
msgstr "选择下列文字颜色以及背景颜色。"

